{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2114928021174124868","created_at":"2026-10-27T03:51:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114928021174124868"],"id":"2114928021174124868","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1817,"like_count":43,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":8},"text":"握住我的脖子你和我就能感觉到爱和幸福了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2114928021174124868"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2114927746396876838","created_at":"2026-10-27T03:50:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114927746396876838"],"id":"2114927746396876838","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1171,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我总是想要是那年我家没破产，是不是我就会跟你一起去看你现在看到的风景，也不会遇到后来的那些人和事，一切的一切都坍塌了，我的世界也一团糟…","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2114927746396876838"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2114927055725047973","created_at":"2026-10-27T03:47:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114927055725047973"],"id":"2114927055725047973","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":959,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我也是人我也会嫉妒和恨，我也会不堪和卑鄙。可是我没办法。人类都是丑陋的。所以我羡慕怪物，怪物拥有着人类无法拥有的那份真实","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2114927055725047973"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2114908606164598997","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:34:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114908606164598997"],"id":"2114908606164598997","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":11276,"like_count":271,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":44,"retweet_count":8},"text":"很匪夷所思日本人把想做爱隐晦成抱抱我吧和想被拥抱，但又透着一股纯爱感和缺爱感","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2114908606164598997"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2114782941184446579","created_at":"2026-10-26T18:15:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114782941184446579"],"id":"2114782941184446579","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1585,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":3},"text":"其实我惴惴不安了很久，然后你开始虐待我，我觉得太好了，这个我可以应付","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2114782941184446579"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2114782339687719116","created_at":"2026-10-26T18:12:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114782339687719116"],"id":"2114782339687719116","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":788,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"谢谢喜欢&gt;_&lt; https://t.co/0FPkU7sJpO","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2114782339687719116"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2114650448389095882","created_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114650448389095882"],"id":"2114650448389095882","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1829,"like_count":45,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我是忧郁的脑残 https://t.co/vlJjXI6Itr","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2114650448389095882"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2114649564028510664","created_at":"2026-10-26T09:25:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114649564028510664"],"id":"2114649564028510664","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":4424,"like_count":125,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":24},"text":"一直被我黏着还会觉得很爽的人到底在哪。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2114649564028510664"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2114579071120429104","created_at":"2026-10-26T04:45:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114579071120429104"],"id":"2114579071120429104","lang":"zh","note_tweet":{"text":"长大之后变成了一个痊愈的文青，并没有腹有诗书气自华，只是带着一层没有长好的皮肤活着，很难看。\n小时候看阅读题里的悲欢离合，呼吸一样平常地分析它们，因为那些文本是封闭的安全的，我可以大彻大悟地共情人物命运，大手一挥写出模范答案，在此之余流下几滴鳄鱼的眼泪，但合上卷子就能走出考场。\n那一点对文学的感知力或许可以叫天赋。\n这种天赋在成年后却会变成一种痛感过敏。我在生活中依旧能看穿暗示和别人的隐喻，依旧能分析情节走向，于是我常常在关系还没破裂时就预见了破裂，我依|日被自然和社会环境影响心境，身体里常年阴雨绵绵，然后怪自己为什么不能像别人一样麻木。\n但天赋总不是诅咒，只是一根多长出来的神经。神经本身不会让人疼痛，它明明可以是丰富，是审美，是理解力，是别人触不到的东西，当然也可以是痛苦的起源。因此天赋不保证幸福，也不保证不幸。它只能让我无法对世界无动于衷。比如老天可能单单是在下雨，人可以把它读成命运，也可以慈悲地只欣赏雨景不这么做。\n文学一旦感召谁，谁就会为文学殉道。"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":33,"impression_count":7796,"like_count":272,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":32},"text":"长大之后变成了一个痊愈的文青，并没有腹有诗书气自华，只是带着一层没有长好的皮肤活着，很难看。\n小时候看阅读题里的悲欢离合，呼吸一样平常地分析它们，因为那些文本是封闭的安全的，我可以大彻大悟地共情人物命运，大手一挥写出模范答案，在此之余流下几滴鳄鱼的眼泪，但合上卷子就能走出考场。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2114579071120429104"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2114578453391712712","created_at":"2026-10-26T04:42:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114578453391712712"],"id":"2114578453391712712","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1163,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"情绪太浓烈的时候很容易说不出话来，要么就干巴巴地重复着一两个词句。其实也很正常，它们占据了我几乎全部的大脑，我只好变得贫瘠","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2114578453391712712"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2114407929541796093","created_at":"2026-10-25T17:25:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114407929541796093"],"id":"2114407929541796093","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1035,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"发现手写文章还是比打字更舒服","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2114407929541796093"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2114404132882936115","created_at":"2026-10-25T17:10:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114404132882936115"],"id":"2114404132882936115","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":29970,"like_count":1340,"quote_count":20,"reply_count":54,"retweet_count":233},"text":"经常性地突然莫名其妙地暴怒，然后焦虑，最后又傻逼逼地抑郁起来","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2114404132882936115"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2114362459956109661","created_at":"2026-10-25T14:24:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114362459956109661"],"id":"2114